   "text": "Victoria University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nVictoria University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nVictoria University (VU) is a world-class university, ranking in the top 3% of universities worldwide (Times Higher Education World University Rankings). It's also the first Australian university to deliver the award-winning way of learning – The VU Block Model.We welcome students from over 45 different countries around the world at our modern, accessible campus, situated in the heart of one of the world’s most liveable cities.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:55\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:55\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$57,480.00\nMin: A$55,488.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n25%\n3,750 of 15,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nEducation Centre of Australia (ECA)\nFounded Year\n1961\nCampus(es)\nSydney, Brisbane\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n07/02/2023\nContract End Date\n31/12/2032\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.vu.edu.au/vu-sydney/sydney-campus-services/living-in-sydney\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X6b73QAT0FY\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
